window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>From </b><b><i>USA Today</i></b><b> best-selling author Rebecca Hefner</b></p> <p><b><i>One woman bred to save the world. Can her team of scientists and soldiers prevail as they find love along the way?</i></b></p> <p><b>Book 1:</b><b><i> A Paradox of Fates</i></b></p> <p>Dr. Elaine \"Lainey\" Randolph must solve time travel to prevent the past. Can she trust the handsome solider who offers protection?</p> <p><b>Book 2: </b><b><i>A Destiny Reborn</i></b></p> <p>Lost in a timeline that was never theirs…. Can two stranded souls save the world while denying their burgeoning attraction?</p> <p><b>Book 3: </b><b><i>A Timeline Restored</i></b></p> <p>Enemies must align to defeat the New Establishment, but can Alora truly forgive Eli for the sins of his past?</p> <p><b><i>Join the ragtag team of time travelers as they endeavor to save the world! Perfect for lovers of sci-fi and paranormal romance, time travel, and romantic suspense!</i></b></p>"; 
